---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Michiel Rollier">
  <section class="home">
    <h1>Simple rules, rich landscapes.</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Michiel, a physicist in Ghent. I spent a PhD on cellular automata: what a simple local rule
      does at scale, and how little of it you can predict without running it. That habit of mind is
      a big part of why I'm now moving into <a href="/ai-safety/">AI safety</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="now"><a href="/ai-safety/">PhD done, BlueDot done, Iliad Intensive next. Looking for what comes after.</a></p>
  </section>
  <div class="play" role="group" aria-label="Game of Life controls">
    <span>
      The background is a Game of Life still life, assembled from the tiles of
      my <a href="https://github.com/mrollier/game-of-life-mosaics">mosaics</a>. Nothing moves until
      you click or drag on it.
    </span>
    <button type="button" data-life="pause">pause</button>
    <button type="button" data-life="step">step</button>
    <button type="button" data-life="clear">clear</button>
    <button type="button" data-life="seed">new still life</button>
  </div>
</Base>
